[TITLE]
Example 7 - Lisboa, Tunel Monsanto-Santa Apolonia (TMSA), illustrative
Alignment: CML ArcGIS service PGDL_tracado; diameter 5.5 m and capacity > 160 m3/s from public PGDL sources
Ground and invert elevations, 0.5% slope and inflows are approximate, not survey data

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2026
